OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly mist and fog across the
OL,6,FProvince at first, which gradually
OL,7,Fburns away as sunny spells develop
OL,8,Ffrom the west. Staying dry with light
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMost staying dry, with
OL,12,Foccasional clear spells and light
OL,13,Fwinds bringing the chance of frost and
OL,14,Ffog patches overnight, chiefly for
OL,15,Frural parts.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FSettled, largely dry fare
OL,18,Fwith bright and sunny spells
OL,19,Fincreasing, but early mist and fog may
OL,20,Fbe slow to burn back. Winds light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
