OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMainly cloudy with patchy light rain
OL,7,Ffocused across the east of the area.
OL,8,FWinds light to moderate easterly.
